    "intro_html":  "Bun thit nuong is the noodle bowl that eats like a salad and satisfies like a barbecue plate: charred pork over cool rice noodles with herbs, cucumber, and a sweet-tangy dressing. Each bowl delivers \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
